{
  "_comment": [
    "Box lane policy (private-flip decision B1, AGENTS.md section 4a). Paths and step names only: no keys, hosts or personal data belong here.",
    "ACTIVE only when the env var ROXIRA_LANE_POLICY points at this file (orch.py, taskq.py add). Without it nothing changes.",
    "Schema and rules: scripts/infra/server_agents/lane_policy.py. Operator guide: docs/ops/BOX_LANE_POLICY.md.",
    "scopes: repo-relative directories or files, no globs (run_task.sh matches by path prefix). Co-located spec files cannot be allowlisted, so scopes are whole directories that contain no denied child.",
    "deny: no lane may touch these. A scope that is inside one OR a parent of one is refused. deny_names: refused wherever the name appears below a scope.",
    "Change this file only through a reviewed PR; a hub or the owner decides what 'non-sensitive' means.",
    "Scopes may be single files (L7 lists box docs one by one: docs/ops also holds prompt, payment, key and unit-file docs)."
  ],
  "ladder": [
    "light",
    "free",
    "paid"
  ],
  "ladder_notes": "light = group agent-light-free, free = agent-strong-free (keep only while the live gateway health check is green), paid = agent-free-paid (capped by the box key's daily USD limit). best (best-all), ds-flash and strong are not allowed on the box key.",
  "require_scope": true,
  "lanes": {
    "L5": {
      "purpose": "core ledger: only ledger acceptance tests, fixtures and accounting docs. Ledger logic stays with the hubs.",
      "scopes": [
        "output_apps/enterprise_hub/modules/accounting/acceptance/",
        "output_apps/enterprise_hub/modules/accounting/__fixtures__/",
        "docs/accounting/"
      ]
    },
    "L6": {
      "purpose": "generic UI building blocks only. Every country pack (de, xx, my, ir, payment_rails) is tax rules, B1 core, hub-only (owner decision 2026-11-23).",
      "scopes": [
        "output_apps/enterprise_hub/frontend/src/components/ui/",
        "output_apps/enterprise_hub/frontend/src/components/layout/"
      ]
    },
    "L7": {
      "purpose": "box, phone and nightly evals: box documentation, eval notes and end-to-end test scaffolding only. Box and deploy scripts stay with the hubs.",
      "scopes": [
        "docs/ops/BOX_LANE_RUNNER.md",
        "docs/ops/BOX_LANE_POLICY.md",
        "docs/ops/BOX_LANE_READINESS.md",
        "docs/ops/BOX_KILL_SWITCHES.md",
